      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-09-11T23:25:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As it says, build prevention is king.&nbsp; I'm more likely to let Blight go through and focus on stopping builds.&nbsp; Unless you're playing against England (don't), fast Explorer movement and destruction are huge, so I like Wind-Lightning,&nbsp;Finder, Fractured Days, Shadows with almost any Aspect, and Starlight with certain growth options.&nbsp; Wildfire should also be good but I don't have a good feel for it yet.</p>",
